    "enUS": {
      "description": "Now that you have both medallions, deliver them to Guard Thomas at the bridge so that he might know the fate of his murdered guards.",
      "dialogue": {
        "882bf465ec3d0d976044": "You have confirmed my fears, $N.  The murlocs are a threat we cannot ignore.",
        "daaec23e3aed3b7c367f": "Hello, $N.  Have you discovered the fates of Rolf and Malakai?"
      },
      "summary": "Deliver Rolf and Malakai's Medallions to Guard Thomas at the eastern Elwynn bridge.",
